msgid "LC ABD memory pool must be completely filled. Any empty slots will be padded with low-tier chips (Cannon, MiniBomb, etc.); the more empty slots, the more low-tier chip types appear."
msgstr "合集 ABD 记忆卡池需要完全填满，如果合集 ABD 记忆池中存在空位，则会出现加农炮、迷你炸弹等低级芯片，空位越多低等级芯片的种类越多。"

msgid "Dark Soul AI (ABD) Guide"
msgstr "各版本暗黑之魂 AI（ABD）性能说明"

msgid "Common Rules (All Versions)"
msgstr "通用规则（各版本共通）"

msgid "Standard pool holds up to 16 unique chips with 4×, 4×, 2×, 2×, 1×12 weights (24 slots), plus up to 5 Mega, 1 Giga, and 1 Program Advance.\nSome chips cannot be recorded in normal play (22 in EXE4, 82 in EXE5; marked with a yellow warning). In EXE4, DarkSword is required in Standard unless all 16 Standard slots are full."
msgstr "标准芯片记忆池最多容纳 16 种不同芯片，按 4×、4×、2×、2×、1×12 的权重分配（共 24 格），另加 Mega 最多 5 格、Giga 1 格、PA 1 格。\n部分芯片在原作正常流程中无法写入 ABD（EXE4 有 22 种，EXE5 有 82 种，编辑器内标黄提示）；EXE4 在标准栏位未填满时必须包含暗黑剑（DarkSword）。"

msgid "Original (GBA)"
msgstr "原版（GBA）"

msgid "Uses the memory pool's exact order and 4/4/2/2/1×12 weights with no Dark Chip priority penalty, no Mega/Giga/PA unlock thresholds, and no extra post-chip buster cooldown."
msgstr "严格按照记忆池内的排序与 4/4/2/2/1×12 权重出牌，无暗黑芯片优先级降权，无高阶芯片解锁门槛，也没有使用特定芯片后的额外连射冷却。"

msgid "Legacy Collection (EXE4 & EXE5)"
msgstr "合集版（Legacy Collection，EXE4 & EXE5）"

msgid "• Dark Chip priority penalty: Dark Chips (including EXE4 DrkVulcn in Mega) cannot occupy the top 4 slots. Only when a Dark Chip is present and fewer than 3 non-Dark Standard chips are registered are the top 3 slots padded with Cannon, MiniBomb, and AirShot (normal builds with 3+ non-Dark Standard chips do not trigger padding and do not need all 16 slots filled). With 4+ non-Dark Standard chips, Dark Chips in the top 4 are swapped down to 1× slots.\n• High-class unlock thresholds (by unique Standard/Dark chip count): Mega unlocks 1/2/3/4/5 slots at 3/6/10/14/16 unique chips; Giga and PA unlock at 12 unique chips."
msgstr "• 暗黑芯片降权：暗黑芯片（含 EXE4 Mega 栏中的暗黑火神炮）不能占据前 4 高权重位。仅当池中存在暗黑芯片且非暗黑标准芯片不足 3 种时，前 3 位才会用加农炮、迷你炸弹、空气炮顺位补齐（正常配入 ≥3 种非暗黑标准芯片时不会触发填充，无需填满全部 16 槽）；当非暗黑标准芯片 ≥4 种时，前 4 位中的暗黑芯片会被换到后排 1× 位。\n• 高阶芯片解锁门槛（按标准/暗黑芯片种类数计算）：达到 3 / 6 / 10 / 14 / 16 种时分别解锁 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 / 5 个 Mega 槽位；Giga 与 PA 需满 12 种才会解锁。"

msgid "Double Team DS (5DS — EXE5 Only)"
msgstr "5DS 版（Double Team DS，仅 EXE5）"

msgid "• Internal ID sort: Before applying 4/4/2/2/1×12 weights, Standard/Dark and Mega pools are sorted by internal BattleChip ID ascending (earlier IDs automatically take the higher 4×/4×/2×/2× weights instead of usage order).\n• Post-chip buster cooldown: After using any Dark Chip, SearchMan (V1/SP/DS), ShakPar (1–3), or BigNoise, the AI must fire 8 three-shot buster runs (vs 2 in Original) before attempting another chip."
msgstr "• 内部芯片 ID 升序重排：在套用 4/4/2/2/1×12 权重前，标准/暗黑池与 Mega 池均强制按游戏内部 BattleChip ID 从小到大排序（编号靠前的芯片自动获得高权重，不再按使用次数排序）。\n• 芯片后强制连射冷却：使用任意暗黑芯片、SearchMan（无印/SP/DS）、ShakPar（1–3）或 BigNoise 后，AI 必须先执行 8 次洛克炮三连射（原版仅 2 次）才能再次尝试出卡。"
